@page "/touch"

<PageTitle>Part06 · Touch Targets</PageTitle>
<h1>触控目标 ≥ 44×44 CSS px</h1>

<p>移动端可点击区域应 ≥ 44px，<code>touch-action: manipulation</code> 减少双击缩放延迟。</p>

<div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center">
    <button class="big-btn">Big (44px)</button>
    <button class="small-btn">Small (16px) — 难点中</button>
</div>

<style>
    .big-btn {
        min-width: 2.75rem;
        min-height: 2.75rem;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: .5rem;
        background: var(--color-surface-container, #f0f0f3);
        touch-action: manipulation;
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    .small-btn {
        min-width: 1rem;
        min-height: 1rem;
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        background: var(--color-surface-container, #f0f0f3);
    }
</style>